# Root .gitignore for DiscordMini Monorepo

# Android / Gradle artifacts
**/.gradle/
**/build/
**/app/build/
**/.kotlin/
**/local.properties
**/captures/
**/.externalNativeBuild/
**/.cxx/

# Maven & Server build artifacts
**/target/
**/bin/

# Database files
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm

# IDE & Tooling files
**/.idea/
**/*.iml
**/.classpath
**/.project
**/.settings/

# OS files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.log

# Personal / Scratch files & folders
md files/
usb.txt
Discordappmin/plan.md
Discordappmin/ui.md
assignment docx/
readme-images/
discordmini-server-key.pem  